  "question": {
    "text": "Consider <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>α</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>), then the value of <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> is"
  },
