  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, their sum equals to zero</p>"
